{"Blacklist comparison lowercases stored blacklisted emails but not the incoming `guest` email, allowing emails like `User@Blacklisted.com` to bypass the blacklist check": 0.9847361445426941, "The `isTeamAdminOrOwner` check uses `&&` (AND) instead of `||` (OR), requiring the user to be both a team admin and owner simultaneously, incorrectly denying access to team admins who are not owners": 0.9897823333740234, "`sendAddGuestsEmails` is called with raw `guests` input instead of `uniqueGuests`, causing existing attendees to incorrectly receive 'scheduled' emails instead of 'guests added' notifications": 0.9848089814186096, "Caught error is not logged - only a static string is printed, making debugging failures impossible": 0.9651772975921631, "`this.calEvent.attendees[0].name` accesses the first element without a bounds check, causing a runtime error if `attendees` is empty": 0.8677392601966858, "When `err.data?.code` is `undefined`, the template literal produces `\"undefined: ...\"` which prevents the fallback message from triggering, showing a confusing message to users": 0.9911273121833801, "Tooltip content `\"Remove email\"` is a hardcoded English string instead of using `t()` for i18n consistency": 0.9193733334541321}